{
  "key": 5135,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "TeamGalacticEternaBuilding4F_Text_IWillDealWithYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Eh? Did you want something?\r",
        "How silly of me to even ask.\n",
        "You want to free the Pokémon.\r",
        "Fine!\n",
        "I, Jupiter, will deal with you.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Euh, c’est à quel sujet?\r",
        "Quelle question stupide.\n",
        "Tu viens pour libérer les Pokémon.\r",
        "Très bien! Moi, Jupiter, je vais te\n",
        "régler ton compte.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TeamGalacticEternaBuilding4F_Text_WellArentYouTough",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, aren’t you tough...?\r",
        "It’s OK, though. Our official Pokémon-\n",
        "statue investigation is finished.\r",
        "Mars has collected energy from\n",
        "the Valley Windworks.\r",
        "We’re pretty much finished here.\n",
        "I’ll let you in on one little thing.\r",
        "Our boss is researching the myths\n",
        "of ancient Pokémon.\r",
        "With the power of mythical Pokémon,\n",
        "he will become the ruler of Sinnoh...\r",
        "I suggest you keep out of Team\n",
        "Galactic’s affairs from now on.\r",
        "This is your last warning!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Eh ben, t’es coriace, toi!\r",
        "Enfin, c’est pas grave. Nous avons fini\n",
        "d’enquêter sur la statue de Pokémon.\r",
        "Mars a récolté l’énergie des Eoliennes.\r",
        "On n’a plus grand-chose à faire ici.\n",
        "Mais je vais te confier un petit secret.\r",
        "Notre chef s’intéresse aux mythes\n",
        "des anciens Pokémon.\r",
        "Il contrôlera Sinnoh grâce aux\n",
        "pouvoirs des Pokémon mythiques...\r",
        "Je te conseille de ne pas mettre le nez\n",
        "dans les affaires de la Team Galaxie.\r",
        "C’est mon dernier avertissement!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TeamGalacticEternaBuilding4F_Text_ClefairyCry",
      "en_US": "CLEFAIRY: Pi...",
      "fr_FR": "MELOFEE: Féeeeee..."
    },
    {
      "id": "TeamGalacticEternaBuilding4F_Text_WhatsWithTeamGalactic",
      "en_US": [
        "What is it with this Team Galactic?\r",
        "Why did they take our Pokémon?\n",
        "What are they trying to accomplish?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est quoi leur problème,\n",
        "à la Team Galaxie?\r",
        "Pourquoi ils prennent nos Pokémon?\n",
        "Qu’est-ce qu’ils ont derrière la tête?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TeamGalacticEternaBuilding4F_Text_ThankYouCruiseByCycleShop",
      "en_US": [
        "I got my CLEFAIRY back, and it’s all\n",
        "thanks to you!\r",
        "But that Team Galactic...\r",
        "They said, “CLEFAIRY came from space.\n",
        "Hand it over!”\r",
        "Their logic baffles me still.\n",
        "It’s like they are from space!\r",
        "Anyway, they’re gone now.\n",
        "Thank you very much!\r",
        "I can’t thank you enough right now,\n",
        "but cruise by my Cycle Shop, OK?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "J’ai récupéré mon MELOFEE\n",
        "grâce à toi!\r",
        "Mais la Team Galaxie, ils ont\n",
        "vraiment un problème...\r",
        "Je les ai entendus dire “MELOFEE vient\n",
        "de l’espace, il nous le faut!”.\r",
        "Tu parles d’une logique, c’est\n",
        "plutôt eux les extraterrestres!\r",
        "Enfin, ils sont partis maintenant.\n",
        "Merci beaucoup!\r",
        "Je n’ai rien à t’offrir pour le moment,\n",
        "mais viens me voir à la Boutique de Vélo!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TeamGalacticEternaBuilding4F_Text_BunearyCry",
      "en_US": "BUNEARY: Myun...",
      "fr_FR": "LAPOREILLE: Lapoooo..."
    },
    {
      "id": "TeamGalacticEternaBuilding4F_Text_WorkingForWorldPeace",
      "en_US": [
        "Working for world peace.\n",
        "              Team Galactic"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Au service de la paix dans le monde.\n",
        "              Team Galaxie"
      ]
    }
  ]
}